  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"745\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\" height=\"365\" rowspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"115\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/images/item/l_logo.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:110/100\" width=\"110\"></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020105072817/http://www.forg.co.kr/Diablo/item_basic.htm\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"아이템기본지식\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/images/item/l_item.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:110/20\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/Diablo/item_gems/\" title=\"젬\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><span class=\"forg-missing\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/images/item/l_gems.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" style=\"width:110px;height:20px;line-height:20px\">젬</span></font></a><a href=\"/site/Diablo/item_jewels/\" title=\"주얼\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><span class=\"forg-missing\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/images/item/l_jewels.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" style=\"width:110px;height:20px;line-height:20px\">주얼</span></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/Diablo/item_runes/\" title=\"룬\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><span class=\"forg-missing\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/images/item/l_runes.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" style=\"width:110px;height:20px;line-height:20px\">룬</span></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/Diablo/item_runewords/\" title=\"룬워드공식\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><span class=\"forg-missing\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/images/item/l_runew.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" style=\"width:110px;height:20px;line-height:20px\">룬워드공식</span></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020105072817/http://www.forg.co.kr/Diablo/item_magicp.htm\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"아템에 새겨지는 의미\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/images/item/l_magicp.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:110/20\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020105072817/http://www.forg.co.kr/Diablo/item_crafted.htm\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"크래프트아이템\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/images/item/l_crafted.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:110/20\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/Diablo/item_setitems/\" title=\"세트아이템\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><span class=\"forg-missing\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/images/item/l_setitems.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" style=\"width:110px;height:20px;line-height:20px\">세트아이템</span></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/Diablo/item_unique/\" title=\"유니크아이템\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><span class=\"forg-missing\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/images/item/l_unique.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" style=\"width:110px;height:20px;line-height:20px\">유니크아이템</span></font></a><a href=\"/site/Diablo/item_charms/\" title=\"참\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><span class=\"forg-missing\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/images/item/l_charms.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" style=\"width:110px;height:20px;line-height:20px\">참</span></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/images/item/l_logo_b.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"5\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:110/5\" width=\"110\"></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"20\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</font><font color=\"olive\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>룬조합방식</b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"309\" width=\"630\">\n<ul>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">■ 소켓이 뚫려있는 아이템을 구하게 된다면 \n                    아래와같은 방식으로 룬을 조합하여</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;황금색 유니크 아템으로 \n                    이름이 변하면서 부가된 능력을 받을 수 있습니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">■ 3개의 룬워드를 필요로 한다면 3소켓의 아이템이 \n                    있어여 합니다 구멍이 남거나 모자른다면</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;아래의 룬워드조합에 \n                    적용을 못하게됩니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">■ 각각의 룬워드 조합은 </font><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><b>Ral + Ort + Tal \n                    </b>만약 이런 공식이라면 </font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;RAL룬을 \n                    끼고 Ort룬을 낀후 Tal룬을 끼어야 합니다.</font></p>\n</ul>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#999999\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"400\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"262\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"265\" src=\"/img/posts/site/Diablo/images/item/rune/rune_main_1.gif\" width=\"130\"></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"271\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">I<img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/images/item/rune/rune_main.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"340\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:140/340\" width=\"140\"></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"539\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">■ 위의 그림처럼 각각의 룬을 삽입하면 완성된 오른쪽 \n                            \n                            상태의 </font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;부가능력을 얻습니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">■ </font><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">Ral + Ort + Tal \n                            의 조합은 3소켓의 방패만이 되고</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;부가능력은 \n                            50%방어상승과 콜드저항력 43%, 파이어,라이트닝,</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;포이즌저항력은 \n                            48% 마지막으로 10%데미지로 마나를 </font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;흡수합니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">■ 위의 방패는 9%방어상승이 있으므로 룬을 \n                            조합하여 +50%의</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;방어 상승이 있으므로 총 \n                            58%의 방어상승이 되므로</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;원래 방어가 86인 방패가 \n                            125로 변하는 것을 볼 수 있습니다.</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<center>\n<table border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#999999\" bordercolorlight=\"#999999\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"549\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\" colspan=\"4\" height=\"30\" width=\"541\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;■ </font><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">아래의 룬워드 공식은 <b>Diablo II: LOD v1.09 \n                                </b>&nbsp;패치 버젼입니다.</font></p>\n</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\" width=\"74\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">룬워드</font></p></th>\n<th align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\" width=\"135\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">허용아이템</font></p></th>\n<th align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\" width=\"82\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">룬조합</font></p></th>\n<th align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\" height=\"30\" width=\"240\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">완성된상태</font></p></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\" width=\"74\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"olive\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><b>Ancient's Pledge</b></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\" width=\"135\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">3 </font><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Socket Shields</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\" width=\"82\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">Ral + Ort + Tal</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\" width=\"240\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">+50% Enhanced Defense<br>\nCold Resist +43%<br>\nFire Resist +48%<br>\nLightning Resist +48%<br>\nPoison Resist +48%<br>\n10% Damage Goes To Mana<br>\n</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\" width=\"74\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"olive\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><b>Black</b></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\" width=\"135\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>3 Socket \nClubs/Hammers/Maces</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\" width=\"82\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">Thul + Io + Nef</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\" width=\"240\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">+120% Enhanced Damage<br>\n40% Chance Of Crushing Blow<br>\n+200 To Attack Rating<br>\nAdds 3-14 Cold Damage - Cold Duration 3 Seconds<br>\n+10 To Vitality<br>\n+19 Poison Damage Over 2 Seconds<br>\n15% Increased Attack Speed<br>\nKnockback<br>\nMagic Damage Reduced By 2<br>\nLevel 4 Corpse Explosion (12 Charges)\n</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\" width=\"74\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"olive\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><b>Fury</b></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\" width=\"135\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">3 Socket Melee Weapons</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\" width=\"82\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">Jah + Gul + Eth</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\" width=\"240\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">+209% Enhanced Damage<br>\n40% Increased Attack Speed<br>\nPrevent Monster Heal<br>\n66% Chance Of Open Wounds<br>\n33% Chance Of Deadly Strike<